|| A. SWISS MODEL ||
----> Homology modeling webserver ,which predicts the 3D structure of protein (AA seq) - Based on tmeplate.
Key features:
1. Automated homology modelling
2. Template search & alignment done automatically using it's in-built database.
3. Builds a full 3D model.
4. Provides a quality score (QMEAN)_to evaluate how good your model is.......

Application:
Helps you visualize protein structures.
Useful in drug desing, structure-function studies & mutational analysis.


|| B. I-TASSER ||
----> Sequence of a protein ---> 3D structure  ---> decides shapes of a protein.
Iterative Threading Assembly Refinement.

It takes protein sequence ----> Predicts structure ----> Possible Function.

Types of I-TASSER TOOLS:
a. I-TASSER
b. LOMETS/ I-TASSER SUITE
c. C-I-TASSER
d. C-I-TASSER-SUITE
e. COFACTOR

Amino acids are last letters --> This tools into structures.


|| C. AlphaFold (THE DESIGNER) ||

-----> To find the 3D structure of proteins.
-- used x-ray crystallography ,NMR, Cryo-EM ( Too slowly technical )

This tool easiest way -- it predicts the 3D structure of proteins directly form the amino acid seq
--> works with AI + Deep Learning
--> provides near-experimental accuracy.

Helps in drug discovery | Disease studies | vaccine design.
Understanding biology at atomic level.

|| Astrology for proteins ||
---> Predicting the future (Protein Shape)
---> Past knowledge (Data)
---> Stars (Aminoacids)




